sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant A as Agent
    C->>A: GET /.well-known/agent-card.json
    A-->>C: AgentCard
    C->>C: pick an interface
    C->>A: SendMessage
    A-->>C: Task (or a direct Message)
    C->>A: GetTask
    A-->>C: Task
